{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121502","id":4076918776,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7zANf4","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121502","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121502.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121502.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121502","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121502/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121502/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121502/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a39826385d6f7d4601974b6030ec7b44721476d4","number":121502,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[LibGodot]: Extend LibGodot Core to the web platform","user":{"login":"NoctemCat","id":22471296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nExtends https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110863 to include the web platform.\r\nRelated to https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/6267 .\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nDemo: https://github.com/NoctemCat/GodotPRDemos/tree/libgodot_web_core\r\n\r\nLibGodot Core part is split from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118976 . The split part only implements it as far as already merged LibGodot Core, so it doesn't do too much additional work. Because of that it is affected by several problems, which include already existing ones:\r\n- You need to manually copy all used `CCFLAGS`, `LINKFLAGS`, etc. yourself (example https://github.com/NoctemCat/LibGodotCoreWebExample/blob/master/SConstruct), which is really verbose for the web platform.\r\n- Doesn't combine static libraries https://redirect.github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111876 so for now only shared LibGodot is working. They can be combined, but every other platform is still affected, so it is left as it is.\r\n- Web iteration is unique and this PR doesn't replicate it properly, so it is similar to https://redirect.github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112044 , related discussion https://redirect.github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/14838 .\r\n\r\nI also checked the original Migeran PR to see if it already implemented the web platform, it didn't.\r\n\r\n### Workflows overview\r\n\r\nSimple editor workflow:\r\n- Build editor as a shared library.\r\n- Build LibGodot `godot-cpp` code using the `Program` scons builder and link the editor library to it.\r\n- Launch the editor and create the project as usual.\r\n\r\nSimple web export workflow:\r\n- Build web godot export template as a shared library, for now the template zip is incomplete (missing `godot.wasm` and emscripten js glue code in `godot.js`).\r\n- Build LibGodot `godot-cpp` code using the `Program` scons builder and with `-sSIDE_MODULE=1` removed.\r\n- Add the resulted wasm file to the template zip as `godot.wasm`, extract `godot.js` and prepend the resulted js file to it, then add it back to the zip.\r\n- Use the finished template zip as a custom template when exporting.\r\n\r\nNo AI used.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/